---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accounting & Bookkeeping | AuditVerse AI"
  description="Automated daily bookkeeping, payroll and financial reporting reviewed by Chartered Accountants."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/accounting-bookkeeping"
  activePage="accounting-bookkeeping"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--white)">Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;color:var(--white);line-height:1.1;">Books that close on day 3, not day 15</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">Automated daily bookkeeping, payroll and financial reporting — reviewed by Chartered Accountants, so accuracy never depends on how busy your finance team is this month.</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Daily Bookkeeping</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Payroll</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Financial Reporting</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Cash Flow</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Automated, Reviewed, Reliable</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Your books, automated daily and reviewed by qualified accountants</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Bank transactions, vendor bills and customer invoices are captured and categorised automatically every day — not batched into a stressful month-end close. A Chartered Accountant reviews exceptions weekly, so nothing slips through unchecked.</p><p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">The result: management accounts you can trust within days of month-end, and a payroll process with zero last-minute surprises.</p>
      <ul class="list-check" style="margin-top:24px;"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Daily automated bookkeeping across all your bank and payment accounts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Full payroll processing including statutory compliance filings</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Monthly management accounts delivered on a fixed, predictable schedule</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="img-frame reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Books that close on day 3, not day 15" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Explore what we automate</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="tabs-nav" data-group="accounting-bookkeeping"><button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="books">Bookkeeping</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="payroll">Payroll</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="reporting">Financial Reporting</button></div>
    
      <div class="tab-panel active" data-group="accounting-bookkeeping" data-tab="books">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Daily Bookkeeping</h4><p>Bank feeds, invoices and expenses categorised and posted automatically, reviewed by our CA team.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div><h4>Bank Reconciliation</h4><p>Automated daily reconciliation across all your business bank accounts and currencies.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>Accounts Payable/Receivable</h4><p>Vendor and customer ledgers maintained with automated ageing and follow-up reminders.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="accounting-bookkeeping" data-tab="payroll">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>Payroll Processing</h4><p>End-to-end payroll runs including statutory deductions, EOBI/GOSI and end-of-service benefits.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Compliance Filing</h4><p>Statutory payroll tax and social security filings handled and tracked automatically.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Leave &amp; Attendance Sync</h4><p>Payroll automatically reflects approved leave, overtime and attendance data.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="accounting-bookkeeping" data-tab="reporting">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Management Reporting</h4><p>Monthly management accounts with variance commentary, delivered on a fixed schedule.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m3 17 6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg></div><h4>Budgeting &amp; Financial Planning</h4><p>Annual budgets and rolling forecasts built collaboratively with your leadership team.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Cash Flow Management</h4><p>13-week cash flow forecasting to keep working capital visible and manageable.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Why this matters for your bottom line</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Faster Close</h4><p>Automated daily postings mean your books are substantially reconciled before month-end even arrives.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Fewer Errors</h4><p>AI-assisted categorisation and matching reduces manual miscoding.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Always Current</h4><p>Live management accounts instead of static spreadsheets updated once a month.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Audit-Ready</h4><p>Every entry is logged with supporting documentation, ready for internal or external audit.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">How We Deliver</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Our engagement process</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 01</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Chart of Accounts Setup</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">We align or rebuild your chart of accounts to support clean, meaningful reporting.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 02</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">System Connection</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Bank feeds, payment gateways and payroll systems are connected for automated data capture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 03</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Automated Categorisation</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">AI categorises transactions; a CA reviews exceptions on a weekly cadence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 04</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Monthly Close</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Reconciliations, accruals and management accounts are finalised on a fixed monthly schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 05</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Ongoing Advisory</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Quarterly reviews to refine reporting and flag emerging financial risks.</p>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Related Services</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Pairs well with</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/bi-dashboards" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>BI Dashboards</h4><p>See your financial position live, not just at month-end.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/internal-audit" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Internal Audit</h4><p>Continuous assurance built on clean, reconciled books.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:840px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Is our data secure with automated bookkeeping? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes — all data is encrypted in transit and at rest, with role-based access controls and full audit logging.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Can you handle multi-currency or multi-entity bookkeeping? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes, this is one of our most common engagement types for logistics and trading clients operating across borders.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Who reviews the automated entries? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>A Chartered Accountant on our team reviews flagged exceptions weekly and signs off on monthly closes.</p></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Ready to put Books that close on day 3, not day 15 to work?</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation and get a tailored automation roadmap within 5 business days.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
